></nav><div class="topbar-end"><div class="topbar-tools"><script type="module" async src="/_yuka/app/demo/client/main.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/theme_menu-c268424b.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Theme_menu" data-id="i1" style="display:contents"><div class="theme_c268424b"><button id="theme-button" class="topbar-link button_c268424b" type="button" aria-label="Theme" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M8 1.75 A6.25 6.25 0 0 1 8 14.25 Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span class="topbar-label">Theme</span></button><!--[--><!--]--></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i1">{}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/nav_progress-a146cfac.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Nav_progress" data-id="i2" style="display:contents" data-start="idle"><div class="bar_a146cfac" data-nav-progress="idle" aria-hidden="true"></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i2">{}</script></div><span class="topbar-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="topbar-link" href="https://github.com/davesnx/yuka" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Yuka on GitHub"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"></path></svg><span class="topbar-label">GitHub</span></a><a class="topbar-link" href="https://x.com/davesnx" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img class="profile-avatar" src="/static/davesnx.jpg" alt="" width="22" height="22"><span>@davesnx</span></a></div></header><div class="app-body"><aside class="sidebar"><nav class="nav"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Issues</a><a class="nav-link" href="/my">My issues</a><a class="nav-link" href="/insights">Insights</a><a class="nav-link" href="/report">Report</a><a class="nav-link" href="/canvas">Canvas</a></nav><div class="sidebar-extra"><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.New_issue" data-id="i3" style="display:contents"><div class="new-issue"><button class="new-issue-button">+ New issue (c)</button><!--[--><!--]--></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i3">{"workspace":"Yuka"}</script></div></aside><main class="main"><yuka-outlet data-k="L0" style="display:contents"><div class="issue-page"><header class="page-header"><a href="/" class="crumb">Issues</a><span class="muted">/</span><span>YUK-1</span></header><div class="issue-layout"><article class="issue-main"><h1 class="issue-title">Hydration mismatch on nested holes</h1><div class="issue-description markdown"><p>A hole inside an <code>each</code> item loses its marker when the item is empty. Reproduce with a filter that matches nothing, then clear it.</p><h3>Steps</h3><ol><li>Open the issue list.</li><li>Type <code>zzz</code> in the filter: no row matches.</li><li>Clear the filter.</li></ol><p>The rows come back, but the <strong>first hole</strong> of each row no longer updates.</p><h3>Cause</h3><p>The printer writes the closing marker only when the item has children:</p><pre class="code-block" tabindex="0" data-language="ocaml"><code><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#bb9af7;--c4:#fb4934;--c5:#0000ff">let</span> <span style="--c0:#dcdcaa;--c1:#61afef;--c2:#88c0d0;--c3:#7aa2f7;--c4:#fabd2f;--c5:#795e26">print_hole</span> buffer ~children <span style="--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#8ec07c">=</span>
  <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#d3869b;--c5:#0000ff">Buffer</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">.</span>add_string buffer <span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#a3be8c;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#a31515">"&lt;!--[--&gt;"</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">;</span>
  <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#d3869b;--c5:#0000ff">List</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">.</span>iter (print buffer) children<span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">;</span>
  <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#fb4934;--c5:#0000ff">if</span> children <span style="--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#8ec07c">&lt;&gt;</span> <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#d3869b;--c5:#0000ff">[]</span> <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#fb4934;--c5:#0000ff">then</span> <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#d3869b;--c5:#0000ff">Buffer</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">.</span>add_string buffer <span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#a3be8c;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#a31515">"&lt;!--]--&gt;"</span></code></pre><blockquote><p>The client looks for the closing marker to know where the hole ends. With no marker it takes the next sibling.</p></blockquote><p>See the <a href="https://github.com/davesnx/yuka/blob/main/docs/islands.md" rel="nofollow noopener">hydration notes</a> for the marker format.</p></div><h2 class="section-title">Activity</h2><!--[s1--><div class="skeleton"><div class="skeleton-line w0"></div><div class="skeleton-line w1"></div><div class="skeleton-line w2"></div></div><!--]--></article><aside class="properties"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/related-a784a2c9.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Issue_props" data-id="i4" style="display:contents" data-start="interaction"><!--[--><div class="props"><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Status</span><span class="property-value"><!--[--><svg class="icon status-in-progress" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M7 3.5 A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 10.5 Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><!--]--><select class="select" aria-label="Status"><option value="in-progress" selected="">In Progress</option><option value="todo">Todo</option><option value="backlog">Backlog</option><option value="done">Done</option><option value="canceled">Canceled</option></select></span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Priority</span><span class="property-value"><!--[--><svg class="icon priority-urgent" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><rect x="1" y="8" width="3" height="6" rx="1" class="bar on"></rect><rect x="5" y="5" width="3" height="9" rx="1" class="bar on"></rect><rect x="9" y="2" width="3" height="12" rx="1" class="bar on"></rect></svg><!--]--><select class="select" aria-label="Priority"><option value="none">No priority</option><option value="urgent" selected="">Urgent</option><option value="high">High</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="low">Low</option></select></span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Assignee</span><span class="property-value"><span class="avatar" title="Maya Chen">MC</span>Maya Chen</span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Labels</span><span class="property-value"><span class="labels"><span class="label label-bug">bug</span><span class="label label-client">client</span></span></span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Created</span><span class="property-value">Nov 2</span></div><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[$--><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Related" data-id="i5" style="display:contents" data-start="visible"><div class="related_a784a2c9"><h2 class="section-title">Related issues</h2><!--[s2--><div class="skeleton"><div class="skeleton-line w0"></div><div class="skeleton-line w1"></div><div class="skeleton-line w2"></div></div><!--]--></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i5">{"related":{"$async":"a1"}}</script><!--]--></div><!--]--></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-answer="l:csrf">{"ok":"TOKEN"}</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-answer="l:issue &quot;YUK-1&quot;">{"ok":{"id":"YUK-1","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Hydration mismatch on nested holes","description":"A hole inside an `each` item loses its marker when the item is empty. Reproduce with a filter that matches nothing, then clear it.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Open the issue list.\n2. Type `zzz` in the filter: no row matches.\n3. Clear the filter.\n\nThe rows come back, but the **first hole** of each row no longer updates.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe printer writes the closing marker only when the item has children:\n\n```ocaml\nlet print_hole buffer ~children =\n  Buffer.add_string buffer \"\u003c!--[-->\";\n  List.iter (print buffer) children;\n  if children \u003c> [] then Buffer.add_string buffer \"\u003c!--]-->\"\n```\n\n> The client looks for the closing marker to know where the hole ends. With no marker it takes the next sibling.\n\nSee the [hydration notes](https://github.com/davesnx/yuka/blob/main/docs/islands.md) for the marker format.","status":"In_progress","priority":"Urgent","assignee":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"labels":["bug","client"],"created_at":"Nov 2"}}</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i4">{"issue":{"id":"YUK-1","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Hydration mismatch on nested holes","description":"A hole inside an `each` item loses its marker when the item is empty. Reproduce with a filter that matches nothing, then clear it.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Open the issue list.\n2. Type `zzz` in the filter: no row matches.\n3. Clear the filter.\n\nThe rows come back, but the **first hole** of each row no longer updates.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe printer writes the closing marker only when the item has children:\n\n```ocaml\nlet print_hole buffer ~children =\n  Buffer.add_string buffer \"\u003c!--[-->\";\n  List.iter (print buffer) children;\n  if children \u003c> [] then Buffer.add_string buffer \"\u003c!--]-->\"\n```\n\n> The client looks for the closing marker to know where the hole ends. With no marker it takes the next sibling.\n\nSee the [hydration notes](https://github.com/davesnx/yuka/blob/main/docs/islands.md) for the marker format.","status":"In_progress","priority":"Urgent","assignee":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"labels":["bug","client"],"created_at":"Nov 2"},"children":null}</script></aside></div></div></yuka-outlet></main></div></div><template data-yuka-fill="s1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/comments-5b092d23.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Comments" data-id="i6" style="display:contents" data-start="idle"><div class="activity"><ul class="comments"><li class="comment" id="comment-c1" tabindex="-1"><span class="avatar" title="Dev Patel">DP</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Dev Patel</b><span class="muted">Nov 2</span></div><div class="comment-text markdown"><p>I can reproduce it. The marker after the empty item is missing.</p></div></div></li><li class="comment" id="comment-c2" tabindex="-1"><span class="avatar" title="Maya Chen">MC</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Maya Chen</b><span class="muted">Nov 3</span></div><div class="comment-text markdown"><p>Found it: <code>print_hole</code> skips the closing marker when the item is <strong>empty</strong>. Working on a fix.</p></div></div></li><li class="comment" id="comment-c3" tabindex="-1"><span class="avatar" title="Tomas Novak">TN</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Tomas Novak</b><span class="muted">Nov 3</span></div><div class="comment-text markdown"><p>Please add a test with an empty filter result.</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="comment-box"><textarea class="comment-input" placeholder="Leave a comment" rows="3"></textarea><!--[--><!--]--><button class="button primary" disabled="">Comment</button></div></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i6">{"issue_id":"YUK-1","me":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"thread":{"first":[{"id":"c1","author":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"body":[["p",{},"I can reproduce it. The marker after the empty item is missing."]],"created_at":"Nov 2"},{"id":"c2","author":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"body":[["p",{},"Found it: ",["code",{},"print_hole"]," skips the closing marker when the item is ",["strong",{},"empty"],". Working on a fix."]],"created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"c3","author":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"body":[["p",{},"Please add a test with an empty filter result."]],"created_at":"Nov 3"}],"hidden":0,"last":[]},"whole_thread":"/issue/YUK-1?comments=all#comment-c3"}</script></template><script>__yukaFill("s1")</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-async="a1">{"ok":[{"id":"YUK-4","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Status menu closes on outside click","description":"The menu stays open when the user clicks the page. Use a backdrop.","status":"Todo","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"labels":["bug"],"created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"YUK-7","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Escape attribute values with quotes","description":"A quote in a title attribute broke the markup.","status":"Done","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"labels":["bug","server"],"created_at":"Oct 27"},{"id":"YUK-9","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Keyed list moves lose focus","description":"Moving an item in a keyed list recreates its DOM when the key stays.","status":"Backlog","priority":"High","assignee":null,"labels":["bug","client"],"created_at":"Nov 1"},{"id":"YUK-14","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Effects must not run on the server","description":"Component bodies run with effects off during rendering.","status":"Done","priority":"Urgent","assignee":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"labels":["bug","server"],"created_at":"Oct 22"}]}</script><template data-yuka-fill="s2"><ul class="related-list_a784a2c9"><li><svg class="icon status-todo" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-4">YUK-4 Status menu closes on outside click</a></li><li><svg class="icon status-done" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M4.5 7.2 L6.4 9 L9.6 5.2" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-7">YUK-7 Escape attribute values with quotes</a></li><li><svg class="icon status-backlog" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-9">YUK-9 Keyed list moves lose focus</a></li><li><svg class="icon status-done" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M4.5 7.2 L6.4 9 L9.6 5.2" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-14">YUK-14 Effects must not run on the server</a></li></ul></template><script>__yukaFill("s2")</script></body></html>
==== /issue/YUK-2 200
<div class="issue-page"><header class="page-header"><a href="/" class="crumb">Issues</a><span class="muted">/</span><span>YUK-2</span></header><div class="issue-layout"><article class="issue-main"><h1 class="issue-title">Stream comments after the shell</h1><div class="issue-description markdown"><p>Send the shell first and the comments later in the same response, with out of order placement.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Part</th><th>Sent</th><th>Placed by</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Shell</td><td>first chunk</td><td>the HTML parser</td></tr><tr><td>Comments</td><td>when the query ends</td><td><code>__yukaFill</code></td></tr><tr><td>Related issues</td><td>last</td><td><code>__yukaFill</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The fill script moves each part into its slot:</p><pre class="code-block" tabindex="0" data-language="javascript"><code><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#bb9af7;--c4:#fe8019;--c5:#0000ff">function</span> <span style="--c0:#dcdcaa;--c1:#61afef;--c2:#88c0d0;--c3:#7aa2f7;--c4:#fabd2f;--c5:#795e26">fill</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984">(</span><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e06c75;--i1:italic;--c3:#e0af68;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">id</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984">)</span> <span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984">{</span>
  <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#bb9af7;--c4:#fe8019;--c5:#0000ff">const</span> <span style="--c0:#4fc1ff;--c1:#e5c07b;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#0070c1">template</span> <span style="--c1:#56b6c2;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#8ec07c">=</span> <span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e5c07b;--c3:#c0caf5;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">document</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">.</span><span style="--c0:#dcdcaa;--c1:#61afef;--c2:#88c0d0;--c3:#7aa2f7;--c4:#fabd2f;--c5:#795e26">getElementById</span><span style="--c3:#9abdf5">(</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#a31515">`</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#a3be8c;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#a31515">yuka-fill-</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#7dcfff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">${</span><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e06c75;--c3:#c0caf5;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">id</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#7dcfff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">}</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#a31515">`</span><span style="--c3:#9abdf5">)</span><span style="--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">;</span>
  <span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#bb9af7;--c4:#fe8019;--c5:#0000ff">const</span> <span style="--c0:#4fc1ff;--c1:#e5c07b;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#0070c1">slot</span> <span style="--c1:#56b6c2;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#8ec07c">=</span> <span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e5c07b;--c3:#c0caf5;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">document</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">.</span><span style="--c0:#dcdcaa;--c1:#61afef;--c2:#88c0d0;--c3:#7aa2f7;--c4:#fabd2f;--c5:#795e26">querySelector</span><span style="--c3:#9abdf5">(</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#a31515">`</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#a3be8c;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#a31515">[data-yuka-slot="</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#7dcfff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">${</span><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e06c75;--c3:#c0caf5;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">id</span><span style="--c0:#569cd6;--c1:#c678dd;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#7dcfff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#0000ff">}</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#a3be8c;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#a31515">"]</span><span style="--c0:#ce9178;--c1:#98c379;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#a31515">`</span><span style="--c3:#9abdf5">)</span><span style="--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">;</span>
  <span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e5c07b;--c3:#c0caf5;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">slot</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">.</span><span style="--c0:#dcdcaa;--c1:#61afef;--c2:#88c0d0;--c3:#7aa2f7;--c4:#fabd2f;--c5:#795e26">replaceWith</span><span style="--c3:#9abdf5">(</span><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e5c07b;--c3:#c0caf5;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">template</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">.</span><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#e06c75;--c3:#7dcfff;--c4:#83a598;--c5:#001080">content</span><span style="--c3:#9abdf5">)</span><span style="--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">;</span>
<span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984">}</span></code></pre></div><h2 class="section-title">Activity</h2><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/comments-5b092d23.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Comments" data-id="L0-i3" style="display:contents" data-start="idle"><div class="activity"><ul class="comments"><li class="comment" id="comment-c4" tabindex="-1"><span class="avatar" title="Sofia Rossi">SR</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Sofia Rossi</b><span class="muted">Nov 3</span></div><div class="comment-text markdown"><p>Should the loading state keep the height of the list?</p></div></div></li><li class="comment" id="comment-c5" tabindex="-1"><span class="avatar" title="Dev Patel">DP</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Dev Patel</b><span class="muted">Nov 3</span></div><div class="comment-text markdown"><p>Yes, a fixed height avoids a jump:</p><pre class="code-block" tabindex="0" data-language="css"><code><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#e50000">.</span><span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#8fbcbb;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#e50000">comments-loading</span> <span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984">{</span>
  <span style="--c0:#9cdcfe;--c2:#8fbcbb;--c3:#0db9d7;--c4:#689d6a;--c5:#e50000">min-height</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">:</span> <span style="--c0:#b5cea8;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#b48ead;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#d3869b;--c5:#098658">120</span><span style="--c0:#b5cea8;--c1:#e06c75;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#f7768e;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#098658">px</span><span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984">;</span>
<span style="--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984">}</span></code></pre></div></div></li></ul><div class="comment-box"><textarea class="comment-input" placeholder="Leave a comment" rows="3"></textarea><!--[--><!--]--><button class="button primary" disabled="">Comment</button></div></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="L0-i3">{"issue_id":"YUK-2","me":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"thread":{"first":[{"id":"c4","author":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"body":[["p",{},"Should the loading state keep the height of the list?"]],"created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"c5","author":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"body":[["p",{},"Yes, a fixed height avoids a jump:"],["pre",{"class":"code-block","tabindex":"0","data-language":"css"},["code",{},["span",{"style":"--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984;--c5:#e50000"},"."],["span",{"style":"--c0:#9cdcfe;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#8fbcbb;--c3:#9ece6a;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#e50000"},"comments-loading"]," ",["span",{"style":"--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984"},"{"],"\n  ",["span",{"style":"--c0:#9cdcfe;--c2:#8fbcbb;--c3:#0db9d7;--c4:#689d6a;--c5:#e50000"},"min-height"],["span",{"style":"--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984"},":"]," ",["span",{"style":"--c0:#b5cea8;--c1:#d19a66;--c2:#b48ead;--c3:#ff9e64;--c4:#d3869b;--c5:#098658"},"120"],["span",{"style":"--c0:#b5cea8;--c1:#e06c75;--c2:#81a1c1;--c3:#f7768e;--c4:#b8bb26;--c5:#098658"},"px"],["span",{"style":"--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#89ddff;--c4:#a89984"},";"],"\n",["span",{"style":"--c2:#eceff4;--c3:#9abdf5;--c4:#a89984"},"}"]]]],"created_at":"Nov 3"}],"hidden":0,"last":[]},"whole_thread":"/issue/YUK-2?comments=all#comment-c5"}</script></article><aside class="properties"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/related-a784a2c9.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Issue_props" data-id="L0-i1" style="display:contents" data-start="interaction"><!--[--><div class="props"><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Status</span><span class="property-value"><!--[--><svg class="icon status-in-progress" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M7 3.5 A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 10.5 Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><!--]--><select class="select" aria-label="Status"><option value="in-progress" selected="">In Progress</option><option value="todo">Todo</option><option value="backlog">Backlog</option><option value="done">Done</option><option value="canceled">Canceled</option></select></span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Priority</span><span class="property-value"><!--[--><svg class="icon priority-high" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><rect x="1" y="8" width="3" height="6" rx="1" class="bar on"></rect><rect x="5" y="5" width="3" height="9" rx="1" class="bar on"></rect><rect x="9" y="2" width="3" height="12" rx="1" class="bar on"></rect></svg><!--]--><select class="select" aria-label="Priority"><option value="none">No priority</option><option value="urgent">Urgent</option><option value="high" selected="">High</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="low">Low</option></select></span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Assignee</span><span class="property-value"><span class="avatar" title="Dev Patel">DP</span>Dev Patel</span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Labels</span><span class="property-value"><span class="labels"><span class="label label-feature">feature</span><span class="label label-server">server</span></span></span></div><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Created</span><span class="property-value">Nov 2</span></div><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[$--><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Related" data-id="L0-i2" style="display:contents" data-start="visible"><div class="related_a784a2c9"><h2 class="section-title">Related issues</h2><!--[--><ul class="related-list_a784a2c9"><li><svg class="icon status-done" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M4.5 7.2 L6.4 9 L9.6 5.2" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-3">YUK-3 Keyboard navigation in the issue list</a></li><li><svg class="icon status-todo" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-5">YUK-5 Decode props of islands</a></li><li><svg class="icon status-done" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M4.5 7.2 L6.4 9 L9.6 5.2" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-7">YUK-7 Escape attribute values with quotes</a></li><li><svg class="icon status-todo" viewBox="0 0 14 14" width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle></svg><a href="/issue/YUK-8">YUK-8 Add a new issue dialog</a></li></ul><!--]--></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="L0-i2">{"related":{"$async":"L0-a1"}}</script><!--]--></div><!--]--></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-answer="l:csrf">{"ok":"TOKEN"}</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-answer="l:issue &quot;YUK-2&quot;">{"ok":{"id":"YUK-2","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Stream comments after the shell","description":"Send the shell first and the comments later in the same response, with out of order placement.\n\n| Part | Sent | Placed by |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Shell | first chunk | the HTML parser |\n| Comments | when the query ends | `__yukaFill` |\n| Related issues | last | `__yukaFill` |\n\nThe fill script moves each part into its slot:\n\n```javascript\nfunction fill(id) {\n  const template = document.getElementById(`yuka-fill-${id}`);\n  const slot = document.querySelector(`[data-yuka-slot=\"${id}\"]`);\n  slot.replaceWith(template.content);\n}\n```","status":"In_progress","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["feature","server"],"created_at":"Nov 2"}}</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="L0-i1">{"issue":{"id":"YUK-2","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Stream comments after the shell","description":"Send the shell first and the comments later in the same response, with out of order placement.\n\n| Part | Sent | Placed by |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Shell | first chunk | the HTML parser |\n| Comments | when the query ends | `__yukaFill` |\n| Related issues | last | `__yukaFill` |\n\nThe fill script moves each part into its slot:\n\n```javascript\nfunction fill(id) {\n  const template = document.getElementById(`yuka-fill-${id}`);\n  const slot = document.querySelector(`[data-yuka-slot=\"${id}\"]`);\n  slot.replaceWith(template.content);\n}\n```","status":"In_progress","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["feature","server"],"created_at":"Nov 2"},"children":null}</script></aside></div></div><script type="application/json" data-yuka-async="L0-a1">{"ok":[{"id":"YUK-3","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Keyboard navigation in the issue list","description":"j and k move the selection, Enter opens the issue. Ignore keys while the filter has focus.","status":"Done","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Oct 30"},{"id":"YUK-5","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Decode props of islands","description":"The client reads the JSON script of each island and decodes the props with the codec.\n\nThe server prints the props next to the island:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"issue_id\": \"YUK-5\",\n  \"me\": { \"id\": \"maya\", \"name\": \"Maya Chen\" },\n  \"comments\": []\n}\n```\n\nThe client decodes them with the codec of the props:\n\n```ocaml\ntype props = { issue_id : string; me : User.t }\n\nlet decode json =\n  match Yuka.Codec.decode props_codec json with\n  | Ok props -> render props\n  | Error message -> Console.error message\n```\n\n- [x] Records and variants\n- [x] Lists and options\n- [ ] Recursive types","status":"Todo","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["feature","codec"],"created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"YUK-7","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Escape attribute values with quotes","description":"A quote in a title attribute broke the markup.","status":"Done","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"labels":["bug","server"],"created_at":"Oct 27"},{"id":"YUK-8","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Add a new issue dialog","description":"Press c to open a dialog with title and description.","status":"Todo","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Nov 4"}]}</script>
